ge, sparking a newfound appreciation for the diversity and dynamism of Kerala's artistic heritage.\nMoney Verse Records serves as a beacon for the youth of Kerala, encouraging them to dream big, break free from conventional norms, and embrace the universal language of music. The label's founders, having taken a leap of faith across continents, are now determined to bring about a transformative wave that will echo through the hearts and playlists of a new generation in Kerala. It's not just a record label; it's a movement, a cultural revolution fueled by the dreams of Kerala-born kids who dared to chase their passions across borders.\n"},"callToAction":{"simpleText":"VISIT CHANNEL"},"dismiss":{"simpleText":"CANCEL"},"endpoint":{"clickTrackingParams":"CAUQ-N4BGAEiEwjn3IP7hJKYAxXE53MBHUZ_MCMyDGl2LWVuZHNjcmVlbkiD6If4x7G9-sYBygEEvFi1PA==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/channel/UCusav3ISwfr_2gUeTNzRfoA","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_CHANNEL","rootVe":3611,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/browse"}},"browseEndpoint":{"browseId":"UCusav3ISwfr_2gUeTNzRfoA"}},"hovercardButton":{"subscribeButtonRenderer":{"buttonText":{"runs":[{"text":"SUBSCRIBE"}]},"subscribed":false,"enabled":true,"type":"FREE","channelId":"UCusav3ISwfr_2gUeTNzRfoA","showPreferences":false,"subscribedButtonText":{"runs":[{"text":"SUBSCRIBED"}]},"unsubscribedButtonText":{"runs":[{"text":"SUBSCRIBE"}]},"trackingParams":"CAYQmysiEwjn3IP7hJKYAxXE53MBHUZ_MCMyDGl2LWVuZHNjcmVlbg==","unsubscribeButtonText":{"runs":[{"text":"UNSUBSCRIBE"}]},"serviceEndpoints":[{"clickTrackingParams":"CAYQmysiEwjn3IP7hJKYAxXE53MBHUZ_MCMyDGl2LWVuZHNjcmVlbsoBBLxYtTw=","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/subscription/subscribe"}},"subscribeEndpoint":{"channelIds":["UCusav3ISwfr_2gUeTNzRfoA"],"params":"EgIIBBgAWAE%3D"}},{"clickTrackingParams":"CAYQmysiEwjn3IP7hJKYAxXE53MBHUZ_MCPKAQS8WLU8","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true}},"signalServiceEndpoint":{"signal":"CLIENT_S