th Sagar\n  / bharath_sagar  \nEditing : Athul Sudhakaran\n  / athuullll  \nCreative Head : Ajmal Noushad\n  / ajmalrnoushad  \nDI Studio : Studio Skwer   / studioskwer  \n\nChief Associate Director : CK Ashif\n  / ckashif_  \nProduction House : Nsane Media\n  / nsanemedia.global  \nAdditional Edit : Art of Shambu\n  / artofshambu  \nArt Director : Lifaas\n  / lifaas_  \nChoreographer : Mruthul C M\n  / mruthul  \nStylist : Gousia Galib\n  / storiesbysiyahhhhhh  \nColorist : Vineesh Vijayan\n  / vineeshvijayan.color  \nVFX : Sreedhar Ganesh\n  / 5reedhar  \nPosters : Thought Station\n  / thought_station_studio  \nTitle Animation: Mohammed Shyfal\n  / shyfxl.gfx  \nLine Producers : Sanjay Sundar\n  / sanjays20  \nJinish George\n  / jinish.george  \nLine Production : Chinna Company\n  / chinnacompany  \nAssociate Director : Samsheer Hameed\n  / _chamchu_  \nSound Design : Sheril Mathew, Rishikesh Ram Raghavan\nMakeup Artist : Ijaz\n  / ijazjomo  \nZara Makeover\n  / zara___makeover  \nCast - Selvaraj, Jeffin Johnson, Risal Kunju ,Roshan George\nHair Stylist: HYPER CUTZ MT (Salman ) \nSaniya Assistant : Shamnas\nAlbum art: Studio 808\n  / studio8o8  \nChief Associate Cinematographer: Jowel Joseph\n  / joweljosephninan  \nAssociate Cinematographer: Ajith Manakkal\nAssociate Choreographer: Hisham Hameed\n  / _.hishamhameed  \nMakeup Associate: Alakananda Jayaraj\nAssistant Directors: Subah Hameed Savad\n  / subahhameedsavada  \nMohammed Shamil\n  / shem.i.i  \nAssistant Choreographers: Harishma\n  / harishmamohann  \nEarnest\n  / earnest_ignus_paul  \nGanga\n  / happyganga_  \nArt Assistants: Abdulla\n  / poy_mukam  \nBijil\n  / bijilbabubb  \nAkshym\n  / akshhhym  \nIsham Haris\nStills: Ajmal Noushad\n  / ajmalrnoushad  \nCreative Consultant: Ross Mariam\nMake up Assistant: Ashik\nFocus Puller: Vipin, Jinu\nGimbal Operator: Anish Joseph\nDrone Operator: Amal Krishna\n  / am4l_krishn4  \nCostumes: Raazia\n  / raazia_official  \nStrada Sutairu\n  / stradasutairu  \nIOWA F