jaz\n  / ijazjomo  \nZara Makeover\n  / zara___makeover  \nCast - Selvaraj, Jeffin Johnson, Risal Kunju ,Roshan George\nHair Stylist: HYPER CUTZ MT (Salman ) \nSaniya Assistant : Shamnas\nAlbum art: Studio 808\n  / studio8o8  \nChief Associate Cinematographer: Jowel Joseph\n  / joweljosephninan  \nAssociate Cinematographer: Ajith Manakkal\nAssociate Choreographer: Hisham Hameed\n  / _.hishamhameed  \nMakeup Associate: Alakananda Jayaraj\nAssistant Directors: Subah Hameed Savad\n  / subahhameedsavada  \nMohammed Shamil\n  / shem.i.i  \nAssistant Choreographers: Harishma\n  / harishmamohann  \nEarnest\n  / earnest_ignus_paul  \nGanga\n  / happyganga_  \nArt Assistants: Abdulla\n  / poy_mukam  \nBijil\n  / bijilbabubb  \nAkshym\n  / akshhhym  \nIsham Haris\nStills: Ajmal Noushad\n  / ajmalrnoushad  \nCreative Consultant: Ross Mariam\nMake up Assistant: Ashik\nFocus Puller: Vipin, Jinu\nGimbal Operator: Anish Joseph\nDrone Operator: Amal Krishna\n  / am4l_krishn4  \nCostumes: Raazia\n  / raazia_official  \nStrada Sutairu\n  / stradasutairu  \nIOWA Fashion\n  / iowafashion_  \nAccessories: Infiniti couture\n  / infiniti_couture  \nGoldencup\n  / goldencup_rental_jewellery  \nStyling Assistant1: S Abirami Shaji\n  / sabhirami  \nStyling Assistant2: Aneesha\n  / anee_ummu  \nDrapist: Akshara karimbil\n  / akshara_karimbil  \nBTS:   / vinayan__haridas  \n@anand_sabu94\nBTS Editor:   / _.fayyx  \n\nDancers:\nNehla Vahab\nElena V S\nAami KP\n⁠⁠Gowri Nandana\n⁠⁠Sethulakshmi\n⁠⁠⁠Vyshnavi\nAmitha S Ram\n⁠⁠Harigoury Nanda\nAishwarya Ranjith\n⁠Sheen kiran\n⁠⁠Theertha Raghu\n⁠Lavanya Pillai\n\nMalabar Gold and Diamonds Team\nThalib Kalfan (Deputy Head - Merchandising)\n⁠Naveen Sankar (Executive - Marketing)\nSanchana Ramakrishnan (Executive - Product)\n⁠Vishnu Vijayan (Executive - Merchandising)\n⁠⁠Hari Mohan (Deputy Manager - Sales \u0026 Service)\n\nPost Production : Nsane Media\nCo-Founder \u0026 Colorist : Vineesh Vijayan\nBusiness Director/Co-Founder : Ranjan Karkera\nBookings